2025-12-24 14:47:40 | INFO | Q234 id=gsm8k_mcq_00233 | baseline_pred=D | gold=D | prompt_variant=strong | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=True | raw=The total number of penguins is 36. One-third of them, which is 36/3 = 12, jump into the ocean and swim. Another one-third, which is also 12, go inside the cave to eat their dinner. Therefore, the number of penguins left sunbathing is 36 - 12 - 12 = 12. The answer is D.
