2025-12-24 15:00:56 | INFO | Q731 id=gsm8k_mcq_00730 | baseline_pred=A | gold=A | prompt_variant=strong | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided, Parker will need 30 packs of gum to last him 30 days because each pack contains 15 pieces of chewing gum and he chews 4 pieces a day. Therefore, the total number of pieces of gum he needs is 30 * 4 = 120 pieces. Since each pack contains 15 pieces of chewing gum, Parker will need 120 / 15 = 8 packs of gum. Therefore, the correct answer is A) 8.
2025-12-24 15:00:57 | INFO | Q667 id=gsm8k_mcq_00666 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=strong | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=If Arelia has $120, then Kassidy has 3/4 * $120 = $90\. Rayna has $60 more than Kassidy, so Rayna has $90 + $60 = $150\. Altogether, they have $120 + $90 + $150 = $360\. If they decide to add together their money and share equally among them, each of them will get $360 / 3 = $120\. Answer: C) 120
