2025-12-24 15:08:16 | INFO | Q909 id=gsm8k_mcq_00908 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=strong | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=After giving 1/5 of his marbles to Jamie, Dean is left with 30*(1-1/5)=30*(4/5)=24 marbles. After giving 10 more marbles to Donald, he is left with 24-10=14 marbles. Therefore, the answer is C) 14.
