2025-12-24 15:09:34 | INFO | Q953 id=gsm8k_mcq_00952 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=strong | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Vince stapled reports from 8:00 AM until 11:00 PM, which is a total of 5 hours. Since Vince can staple 30 reports every 15 minutes, he will be able to staple a total of 5 * 30 = 150 reports during this time period. Therefore, the correct answer is D) 450.
