2025-12-24 15:37:53 | INFO | Q520 id=gsm8k_mcq_00519 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=medium | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, we can set up the following equation:\n\nRoyce time = Double Rob time + 40 minutes\n\nSubstituting Rob's time of 2 hours (which is 120 minutes), we get:\n\nRoyce time = 2 * 120 + 40\nRoyce time = 240 + 40\nRoyce time = 280\n\nTherefore, Royce takes 280 minutes to shingle a house.\n\nAnswer: A) 280
