2025-12-24 15:55:51 | INFO | Q1067 id=gsm8k_mcq_01066 | baseline_pred=A | gold=B | prompt_variant=medium | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=The glee club ordered 20 pizzas and ate 70% of them, so they ate 20 * 0.7 = 14 pizzas. The football team ordered twice as many pizzas as the glee club, which is 20 * 2 = 40 pizzas. They ate 80% of them, so they ate 40 * 0.8 = 32 pizzas. Together, the glee club and the football team ate 14 + 32 = 46 pizzas. Since there were 20 + 40 = 60 total pizzas ordered, the number of pizzas left is 60 - 46 = 14.\n\nTherefore, the answer is (A).
