2025-12-24 16:01:27 | INFO | Q1310 id=gsm8k_mcq_01309 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=medium | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=My apologies, I made a mistake in my previous response. Let me provide the correct answer.\nBased on the information provided in the audio, we can create the following table:\n\n|Name| Amount Raising|\n|---|---|\n|Kim| $320 more than Alexandra|\n|Alexandra| $430|\n|Maryam| $400 more than Sarah|\n|Sarah| $300|\nTo find the total amount of money raised by all four girls, we need to add up the amounts raised by each girl. We can do this by adding the amounts raised by Kim, Alexandra, Maryam, and Sarah.\nTotal = $320 + $430 + $400 + $300 = $1450\nTherefore, the total amount of money raised by all four girls is $1450.\nThe answer is A) $2280.
