2025-12-24 16:15:02 | INFO | Q311 id=gsm8k_mcq_00310 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=The total cost of the business suits is 6 * $100 = $600\. The cost of the three suitcases is 3 * $50 = $150\. The cost of the flight ticket is $700 + 5 * $100 = $800\. The total cost of all the items mentioned is $600 + $150 + $800 = $1550\. To save $2000, Theo needs to spend $1550 - $2000 = -$450\. This means that Theo has to spend $450 on buying gifts for his business partners in South Africa.\nTherefore, the answer is A) $4050.
2025-12-24 16:15:05 | INFO | Q341 id=gsm8k_mcq_00340 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, it seems that Josh started off practicing juggling 3 balls and then gradually increased the number of balls he was juggling each week. By the end of the fourth week, he was likely performing with 3 balls. However, during his performance at the talent show, he slipped and dropped all 3 of his balls. Two of them were caught by people in the audience, but one got lost because the auditorium was dark. Therefore, the correct answer to the question is D) 3.
2025-12-24 16:15:06 | INFO | Q313 id=gsm8k_mcq_00312 | baseline_pred=A | gold=A | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided, we can set up the following equations:\n\nTrent = Jane + 5\nJane = Quinn - 3\n\nSubstituting the second equation into the first equation, we get:\n\nTrent = (Quinn - 3) + 5\nTrent = Quinn + 2\n\nGiven that Quinn is 30, we can substitute this value into the equation above to find Trent's age:\n\nTrent = 30 + 2\nTrent = 32\n\nTherefore, Trent is 32 years old.\n\nAnswer: A) 32
