2025-12-24 16:20:02 | INFO | Q539 id=gsm8k_mcq_00538 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided, Emma was unable to complete the full number of vlogs for the month. She made 18 vlogs in the first week, 21 vlogs in the second week, and 15 vlogs in the third week, totaling 54 vlogs. To complete the 72 vlogs per month, she would need to make up the remaining 18 vlogs. Therefore, the answer is A) 18.
