2025-12-24 16:22:14 | INFO | Q627 id=gsm8k_mcq_00626 | baseline_pred=B | gold=D | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided, Ashley's internet connection speed in MB per hour can be calculated as follows:\n\n20KB/second * 3600 seconds/hour = 7200 KB/hour\n\nSince 1MB = 1000KB, Ashley's internet connection speed in MB per hour is:\n\n7200 KB / 1000 KB/MB = 7.2 MB/hour\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D) 72.\n\n反思：本题考察基本的单位换算和数据计算能力。在进行此类题目时，需要注意单位之间的换算关系，并且要仔细读题，理解题目的要求。同时，也要注意不要漏掉选项中的字母。
2025-12-24 16:22:15 | INFO | Q560 id=gsm8k_mcq_00559 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Juan drinks 10 times the amount of coffee that Octavia drinks, which means he currently consumes 50 cups of coffee per day (10 x 5 = 50). To reduce his coffee intake to the daily recommendation of 4 cups, Juan must reduce his coffee consumption by 46 cups (50 - 4 = 46).\nTherefore, the correct answer is A) 36.
