2025-12-24 16:23:59 | INFO | Q618 id=gsm8k_mcq_00617 | baseline_pred=B | gold=B | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=The weight of the bull is 750kg, and Prince sells 15kg of meat every hour. To find out how many days it will take him to sell the entire bull, we need to divide the total weight of the bull by the amount of meat Prince sells per hour.\nSo, it will take王子 (Prince) 750 ÷ 15 = 50 hours to sell the bull.\nSince Prince works 10 hours a day, it will take him 50 ÷ 10 = 5 days to sell the bull.\nTherefore, the correct answer is D) 50.
