2025-12-24 16:24:01 | INFO | Q696 id=gsm8k_mcq_00695 | baseline_pred=B | gold=B | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=B | followup_correct=True | raw=The total number of bucks in the field is 50% of 50, which equals 25 bucks. Out of these, 20% are 8-point bucks, so there are 25 * 20 / 100 = 5 8-point bucks in the field. Therefore, the answer is B) 5.
