2025-12-24 16:25:22 | INFO | Q669 id=gsm8k_mcq_00668 | baseline_pred=C | gold=B | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, we can calculate that out of the 50 employees, 20% of them are management. This means that there are 20/100 * 50 = 10 employees who are management.\nOut of these 10 management employees, only 30% of them oversee the entire company. This means that there are 30/100 * 10 = 3 employees who oversee the entire company.\nTherefore, the answer to the question is C) 3.
