2025-12-24 16:30:09 | INFO | Q928 id=gsm8k_mcq_00927 | baseline_pred=C | gold=B | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=False | raw=If a mini pastry has one-third the calories of a normal version, then each mini cinnamon roll has 600 / 3 = 200 calories and each mini blueberry muffin has 450 / 3 = 150 calories. Therefore, the total number of calories in the 200 mini cinnamon rolls is 200 x 200 = 40000 calories. The total number of calories in the 300 mini blueberry muffins is 150 x 300 = 45000 calories. Altogether, Andrew baked 40000 + 45000 = 85000 calories worth of pastries. Answer: C) 85000
