2025-12-24 16:31:37 | INFO | Q969 id=gsm8k_mcq_00968 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=The total time it will take Andy to string all the racquets is 3 + 5 + 4 = 12 racquets. To find the total time it will take him, we need to multiply the number of racquets by the time it takes him to string each type of racquet. The time it takes him to string each type of racquet is as follows:\n\n- Synthetic gut: 15 minutes per racket\n- Polyester string: 22 minutes per racket\n- Hybrid set: 18 minutes per racket\n\nSo, the total time it will take him to string all the racquets is:\n\n12 racquets * 15 minutes/racket + 12 racquets * 22 minutes/racket + 12 racquets * 18 minutes/racket = 180 minutes + 264 minutes + 216 minutes = 650 minutes\n\nTherefore, the answer is C) 215. It will take Andy approximately 215 minutes to string all the racquets.
