2025-12-24 16:35:48 | INFO | Q1122 id=gsm8k_mcq_01121 | baseline_pred=B | gold=B | prompt_variant=low | followup_pred=B | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the question, we can set up the equation:\nSofie's distance = 2 * Brian's distance\nSince Sofie plans to walk 10 miles every day for 7 days, her total distance will be:\nSofie's distance = 10 miles x 7 = 70 miles\nSubstituting this value into the equation above, we get:\n70 miles = 2 * Brian's distance\nDividing both sides by 2, we get:\nBrian's distance = 35 miles\nTherefore, Brian will walk 35 miles in 7 days.\nAnswer: B
