2025-12-24 16:52:40 | INFO | Q277 id=gsm8k_mcq_00276 | baseline_pred=D | gold=D | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, we can calculate the number of cards that have the letter D as follows:\n\nFirst, we find half of the remaining cards after subtracting the cards with letter A from the total number of cards:\n\n80 cards - 2/5 * 80 cards = 48 cards\n\nNext, we find 5/8 of the remaining cards that do not have letter A or B:\n\n48 cards - 1/2 * 24 cards = 24 cards\n\nFinally, we add the number of cards with letter A and B to find the total number of cards with letter D:\n\n24 cards + 1/2 * 24 cards = 18 cards\n\nTherefore, there are 18 cards with the letter D.\n\nAnswer: D) 18
