2025-12-24 16:55:47 | INFO | Q393 id=gsm8k_mcq_00392 | baseline_pred=A | gold=B | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Tim saves 20% for bundling when subscribing to Hulu and Disney Plus. This means that he would pay $10 x 80% = $8 for both services instead of $10 x 2 = $20 if he were to subscribe to them separately. Therefore, Tim saves $20 - $8 = $12 by bundling his streaming services.\nTherefore, the answer to the question is A) 12.
2025-12-24 16:55:49 | INFO | Q336 id=gsm8k_mcq_00335 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Mason needs 30 ounces of sugar for each batch of suckers and 70 ounces of sugar for each batch of fudge. To make 8 batches of suckers, he would need 8 * 30 = 240 ounces of sugar. To make 1 batch of fudge, he would need 70 ounces of sugar. Therefore, Mason would need 240 + 70 = 310 ounces of sugar to make 8 batches of suckers and 1 batch of fudge. The correct answer is C) 310.
