2025-12-24 16:58:47 | INFO | Q432 id=gsm8k_mcq_00431 | baseline_pred=A | gold=D | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Dora needs $6 + $11 + $2 = $19 to buy the skipping rope, the game, and the ball. She has saved $2 and received $16 from her mother, so she needs $19 - $2 - $16 = $11 more. Therefore, the correct answer is A) 11.
