2025-12-24 17:07:52 | INFO | Q751 id=gsm8k_mcq_00750 | baseline_pred=D | gold=B | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Candy will be able to rent out a total of 60 * 4 = 240 chairs during the weekdays in one month. During the weekends, she will be able to rent out 100 * 4 = 400 chairs in one month. Therefore, in total, Candy will be able to rent out 240 + 400 = 640 chairs in one month. Since there are 2 months in a 4-week period, Candy will be able to rent out a total of 640 * 2 = 1280 chairs in two 4-week periods. The answer is A) 2000.
