2025-12-24 17:15:15 | INFO | Q1068 id=gsm8k_mcq_01067 | baseline_pred=C | gold=D | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Anthony wants to send out 700 small coupons and twice as many big coupons, so he will send out 700 * 2 = 1400 big coupons. Each small coupon costs 5 cents to mail, and each big coupon costs 15 cents, so the total cost of mailing the small coupons is 700 * 5 cents = $350\. The total cost of mailing the big coupons is 1400 * 15 cents = $2100\. Therefore, the total cost of mailing all the coupons is $350 + $2100 = $2450\. Answer: A) 24500
