2025-12-24 17:16:22 | INFO | Q1036 id=gsm8k_mcq_01035 | baseline_pred=B | gold=A | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=B | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, it can be calculated that it will take Richard 24 / 3 = 8 bottles of soda to set up all the soda fountains along his driveway. Since it takes him 5 seconds to move from one bottle to the next, it will take him 8 * 5 = 40 seconds in total to set up all the soda fountains. Therefore, the correct answer is B) 40.
