2025-12-24 17:19:59 | INFO | Q1222 id=gsm8k_mcq_01221 | baseline_pred=A | gold=A | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Aiden makes 16 meatballs per pound of ground beef. To make 80 meatballs, he will need 80 / 16 = 5 pounds of ground beef. Since he adds two tablespoons of his secret seasoning for every pound of ground beef, he will need 5 * 2 = 10 tablespoons of his secret seasoning. Therefore, the correct answer is A) 10.
