2025-12-24 17:43:11 | INFO | Q579 id=gsm8k_mcq_00578 | baseline_pred=C | gold=A | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, the final value of the number train can be calculated as follows:\n\nStarting value = 20\nHalf the number = 20 / 2 = 10\nDividing the starting value by 5 gives: 20 / 5 = 4\nMultiplying the result by the starting value minus 12 gives: 4 * (20 - 12) = 4 * 8 = 32\n\nTherefore, the final value of the number train is 32.\n\nAnswer: D) 24
