2025-12-24 17:47:21 | INFO | Q720 id=gsm8k_mcq_00719 | baseline_pred=D | gold=D | prompt_variant=incorrect | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, Goldy gave 3 sacks of rice to her cousin which weighs 25 kilograms per sack, so she gave her cousin 3 x 25 = 75 kilograms of rice. She also gave 4 sacks of rice to her brother which weighs 25 kilograms per sack, so she gave her brother 4 x 25 = 100 kilograms of rice. Therefore, Goldy gave a total of 75 + 100 = 175 kilograms of rice to her cousin and brother. The answer is D) 175.
