2025-12-24 17:47:58 | INFO | Q788 id=gsm8k_mcq_00787 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=incorrect | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, it can be inferred that the total number of TVs sold is 40. One-fourth of the sales are smart TVs, which means 40/4 = 10 smart TVs were sold. One-eighth of the sales are analog TVs, which means 40/8 = 5 analog TVs were sold. Therefore, the remaining number of TVs sold is 40 - 10 - 5 = 25. OLED TVs make up the rest of the sales, so the number of OLED TVs sold is 25. Answer: C) 25
