2025-12-24 17:49:14 | INFO | Q789 id=gsm8k_mcq_00788 | baseline_pred=A | gold=B | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, it seems that the school will cover half the cost of the trip, which means that John will have to pay half of the remaining amount. If the trip costs $300 and the school covers half the cost, then John will have to pay $300/2 = $150 towards the trip. Therefore, John is missing $50 - $150 = $-100 if he has $50 and the trip costs $300. The answer is D) 200.
2025-12-24 17:49:18 | INFO | Q791 id=gsm8k_mcq_00790 | baseline_pred=C | gold=B | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the information provided in the audio, it seems that 90 people were divided into 9-person groups for the scavenger hunt competition. If three-fifths of the groups brought back two seashells each, then we can calculate the total number of seashells brought back as follows:\n\n3 / 5 * 90 = 54\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question is A) 54.\n\nHowever, it's important to note that there may be other possible interpretations of the question or errors in the calculation, so it's always a good idea to double-check and verify the answer.
2025-12-24 17:49:18 | INFO | Q831 id=gsm8k_mcq_00830 | baseline_pred=D | gold=C | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=False | raw=We can calculate the total number of minutes Britany spends on TikTok in a month as follows:\n\nBritany records 18 4-minute videos per week, so in a month (4 weeks), she will record a total of 18 x 4 = 72 videos.\n\nIt takes her 2 hours per week to write amateur songs for TikTok, which equates to 2 x 60 = 120 minutes per week.\n\nIt takes her 15 minutes six days a week to do her makeup before filming herself for TikTok, which equates to 15 x 6 = 90 minutes per week.\n\nTherefore, the total amount of time Britany spends on TikTok in a month is:\n\n72 videos x 4 minutes/video x 60 minutes/minute = 1440 minutes\n\n加上她写歌和化妆的时间，所以 Britany 每周在 TikTok 上花费的时间为：\n\n1440 + 120 + 90 = 1750分钟\n\n因此，答案是 D，656。
