2025-12-24 18:14:26 | INFO | Q266 id=gsm8k_mcq_00265 | baseline_pred=B | gold=D | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=False | raw=The total cost of the house, including the brokerage fee and transfer fee, is 5% of $350,000 + 12% of $350,000 = $18,000 + $42,000 = $60,000. This is $60,000 more than Mrs. Cruz's budget of $400,000. The answer is C: 18000.
