2025-12-24 18:15:00 | INFO | Q291 id=gsm8k_mcq_00290 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant=incorrect | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the information given in the audio, we can set up the following equation:\n\n22 + X = 10 * (Y - 5)\n\nWhere:\nX = total number of medals won by Ali and Izzy together\nY = total number of medals given out for counting\n\nSolving this equation, we get:\n\nX = 82\n\nTherefore, the total number of medals given out for counting is 82 * 10 = 820.\n\nSo the answer is C) 390.
