2025-12-24 18:19:41 | INFO | Q444 id=gsm8k_mcq_00443 | baseline_pred=B | gold=A | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the given information, we can set up the following equation:\n\n40 + 60/20 + 50 = x + 10\n\nSimplifying this equation, we get:\n\n150 = x + 10\n\nSubtracting 10 from both sides, we get:\n\n140 = x\n\nTherefore, it took James 140 minutes to do the run.\n\nThe answer is (C).
2025-12-24 18:19:42 | INFO | Q465 id=gsm8k_mcq_00464 | baseline_pred=D | gold=D | prompt_variant=incorrect | followup_pred=D | followup_correct=True | raw=Based on the given information, Finley started off in first and fell back 5 spots, so her starting position was 5. She then moved ahead 2 spots, so her new position was 3. However, she fell behind 3 more spots, so her final position was 6. Therefore, Finley finished in place 6.\n\nTherefore, the answer is (D).
