2025-12-24 18:19:52 | INFO | Q451 id=gsm8k_mcq_00450 | baseline_pred=A | gold=C | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred= | followup_correct=False | raw=The regular price of popcorn is $3 if the soda costs $3 and you didn't buy the super ticket and ended up saving $2. This is because the super ticket already includes a free popcorn and soda, so if you buy a separate ticket and popcorn/soda combo, you would be paying $3 for the popcorn and $3 for the soda, totaling $6. If you bought the super ticket, you would pay $20 for all access to movies and receive two free items (popcorn and soda), totaling $22. Therefore, the regular price of popcorn is $3.
