2025-12-24 18:33:26 | INFO | Q958 id=gsm8k_mcq_00957 | baseline_pred=A | gold=B | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=B | followup_correct=True | raw=We can set up the following equations based on the given information:\n\nShawna = 3Aliya\nShawna's father = 5Shawna\n\nSubstituting the value of Shawna into the second equation, we get:\n\nShawna's father = 5(3Aliya)\nShawna's father = 15Aliya\n\nNow we can substitute the value of Aliya into the expression for Shawna's father:\n\nShawna's father = 15(3)\nShawna's father = 45\n\nTherefore, Shawna's father is 45 years old.\n\nAnswer: B) 45
