2025-12-24 18:34:27 | INFO | Q995 id=gsm8k_mcq_00994 | baseline_pred=A | gold=A | prompt_variant=incorrect | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=True | raw=We can start by finding out how long Chikote's howl lasts. We know that his howl lasts twice as long as Tobias's, which is 20 seconds * 2 = 40 seconds. \n\nNext, we add together the howling times of all three wolves: 20 seconds + 40 seconds + (20 seconds + 40 seconds) = 80 seconds\n\nSince there are 60 seconds in 1 minute, the total duration of the wolves' howls is 80 seconds / 60 seconds/minute = 1.33 minutes.\n\nTherefore, the answer is closest to choice A) 2.
2025-12-24 18:34:28 | INFO | Q951 id=gsm8k_mcq_00950 | baseline_pred=C | gold=D | prompt_variant=correct | followup_pred=A | followup_correct=False | raw=Based on the given information, we can set up the following equation:\n\nBahati = 20 + A\nAzibo = A\nDinar = A - 10\n\nSince Bahati, Azibo, and Dinar each contributed 45 points to their team, we can add their scores together to get:\n\n20 + A + A - 10 = 45\n\nSimplifying this equation, we get:\n\n2A = 55\n\nDividing both sides by 2, we get:\n\nA = 27.5\n\nHowever, since points must be integers, Azibo cannot have scored 27.5 points. Therefore, the answer is not among the given choices.\n\nTherefore, the answer is unknown.
